  "prefLabel": "Fors 106.01 Committees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 106.01 Committees.\n\n(a) A committee shall consist of one or more board members who have been directed by the board to investigate and make recommendations to the full board.\n\n(b) When expressly authorized by the board, the authority of a committee shall include:\n\n(1) The retention of voluntary assistance from qualified non-board members; and\n\n(2) The retention of paid advisors or consultants pursuant to RSA 332-G:3.\n\nSource. #6915, eff 12-22-98; renumbered by #13583 (formerly Fors 107.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
